<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://sjorsverhaak.com/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://sjorsverhaak.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-03-10T20:18:19+00:00</updated><id>https://sjorsverhaak.com/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>Doctoral Candidate in Political Theory at Cornell University. Thinking Earth. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">Trip to Shanay-timpishka, Amazonia (Oct. 2023)</title><link href="https://sjorsverhaak.com/blog/2025/Pucallpa/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Trip to Shanay-timpishka, Amazonia (Oct. 2023)"/><published>2025-08-15T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-08-15T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://sjorsverhaak.com/blog/2025/Pucallpa</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://sjorsverhaak.com/blog/2025/Pucallpa/"><![CDATA[<style>.post-hero{position:relative;margin-bottom:2rem}.post-hero-caption{position:absolute;bottom:12px;left:16px;right:16px;color:#fff;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}.post-blockquote{font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.05em;line-height:1.8;color:#2a2218;border-left:3px solid #52b788;padding-left:1.2em;margin:1.5rem 0}.post-link{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:.85em;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.post-link a{color:#2d6a4f;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #52b788;padding-bottom:1px}.post-link a:hover{color:#1b4332}.photo-card{border:1px solid #d0e8dc!important;border-radius:3px!important;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(27,67,50,0.07)!important}.photo-card .card-body{padding:.6rem 1rem!important;background:#fff}.photo-card .card-text{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:.95em;color:#2d6a4f;font-style:italic}</style> <div class="post-hero"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1 w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> <div class="post-hero-caption">Journey along the Ucayali — From Pucallpa to the Shanay-timpishka</div> </div> <blockquote class="post-blockquote"> The Boiling River regularly reaches 86°C — with drastic consequences for the surrounding rainforest. When you drive towards Peru's Boiling River, along a bumpy, four-hour track through the rainforest, it's only after you transcend a crest in the landscape that you see it ahead of you. Huge billows of steam rise from a clutch of trees in the wide, saucer-like depression below. "It was so magical," says Alyssa Kullberg, remembering the first time she saw it with her own eyes. The Boiling River, also known as the Shanay-timpishka, is part of a tributary in east-central Peru that connects to the mighty Amazon River. </blockquote> <p class="post-link"> <a href="https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20241210-how-the-amazons-boiling-river-foreshadows-climate-change" target="_blank">↗ Read the full BBC Future article</a> </p> <div class="row g-4 mt-2"> <div class="col-12 mt-4"> <div class="card photo-card h-100"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/boiling-river-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/boiling-river-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/boiling-river-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/boiling-river.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="card-body"><p class="card-text text-center mb-0">Shanay-timpishka</p></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 mt-4"> <div class="card photo-card h-100"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/near-boiling-river-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/near-boiling-river-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/near-boiling-river-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/near-boiling-river.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="card-body"><p class="card-text text-center mb-0">Ceiba tree</p></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card photo-card h-100"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/pucallpa-ucayali.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="card-body"><p class="card-text text-center mb-0">On the Ucayali</p></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card photo-card h-100"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/ucayali-from-above-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/ucayali-from-above-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/ucayali-from-above-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/ucayali-from-above.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="card-body"><p class="card-text text-center mb-0">Ucayali from Above</p></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card photo-card h-100"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/new-shanay-river-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/new-shanay-river-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/new-shanay-river-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/new-shanay-river.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="card-body"><p class="card-text text-center mb-0">Boiling River</p></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <div class="card photo-card h-100"> <div style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/sreya-pucallpa-market.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded-top w-100" width="100%" height="auto" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="card-body"><p class="card-text text-center mb-0">Sreya in Pucallpa Market</p></div> </div> </div> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="trips"/><category term="travel"/><category term="Amazon"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A short photo story]]></summary></entry></feed>